Argus is a Server maintainance Discord Bot 


homelab-bot/
│
├── main.py
├── config.py
├── example.env
│
├── cogs (Discord Commands)
│   ├── system.py (/processes,/status,/uptime,/ping,/help)
│   └── updates.py (/update)
│
├── monitoring
│   ├── resources.py (psutils-Collects CPU, RAM, swap, disk usage, uptime data)
│   └── alerts.py (checks configured thresholds, sends Discord alerts)
│
├── services
│   ├── apt.py (checks available package updates, retrieves package details, requests installation)
│   └── systemd.py ()
│
└── scripts
    └── homelab-apt-update

